<pre class="code-block" aria-label="ASCII comparison of genuine and counterfeit medicine boxes">         <span class="verified">GENUINE</span>                         <span class="counterfeit">COUNTERFEIT</span>

  +--------------------+           +--------------------+
  |  . MEDICURE  500mg |           |  . MEDICURE  500mg |
  |  ----------------  |           |  ----------------  |
  |  Batch: SG-2024-07 |           |  Batch: SG-2024-07 | <span class="counterfeit">← copied</span>
  |  Exp:   12/2026    |           |  Exp:   12/2026    |
  |                    |           |                    |
  |  [#.#.]    [#.#.]  |           |  [#.#.]    [#.#.]  |
  |  [.#.#]  . [.#.#]  |           |  [.#.#]  . [.#.#]  | <span class="counterfeit">← cloned QR</span>
  |  [REG NO: P12847]  |           |  [REG NO: P12847]  | <span class="counterfeit">← forged</span>
